{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/header.jpg?t=1749139572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A VTuber-themed collectible card game co-developed by <strong>NinthGames</strong> in collaboration with <strong>Season Journey</strong>, <strong>PalaBoom8</strong>, <strong>PTS (Public Television Service)</strong>,<strong>Sparkle Cloud</strong> , <strong>Dream City</strong>, and <strong>Akutagawa</strong>.<br>This game innovatively blends VTuber culture with strategic card battles. By combining traditional collectible card mechanics with real-time strategy elements, players can assemble powerful VTuber lineups and engage in intense tactical showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free to Play \u2013 All Characters Unlockable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</i> adopts a fully free-to-play model.<br>All cards are obtainable through gameplay\u2014no paywalls.<br>Jump in and start battling online with other players right away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/\u5922\u90fd\u8cc7\u8a0a\u689d.png?t=1749139572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/\u5bae\u6c0f\u8cc7\u8a0a\u689d__1_.png?t=1749139572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Visuals &amp; Immersive Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every VTuber card illustration is crafted by professional artists, capturing the unique charm and personality of each character.<br>Skill animations, visual effects, and voice acting elevate the experience, making each match feel like a thrilling live VTuber broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/\u5b63\u9014\u8cc7\u8a0a\u689d.png?t=1749139572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/\u82a5\u5ddd\u8cc7\u8a0a\u689d.png?t=1749139572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About NinthGames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NinthGames is a pioneering studio focused on VTuber and game development.<br>We strive to merge the essence of VTuber culture with interactive entertainment.<br><i>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</i> is our bold new step toward creating a unique card battle experience like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/\u7b2c\u4e5d\u8cc7\u8a0a\u689d.png?t=1749139572\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598250?t=1749139572","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598250?t=1749139572","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/5e1e0c520d212333ded54ca96178f56bb2d12b32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749139572","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/5e1e0c520d212333ded54ca96178f56bb2d12b32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749139572","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598250/extras/header.jpg?t=1749139572\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Virtual Frenzy - Nexus Corps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A VTuber-themed collec